------------------------------------------------------------------------
SCOPE
------------------------------------------------------------------------

This license applies to:
  - the dataset files (*.json, *.csv) in data/
  - the source code (*.py) in code/
  - the figure files (*.png, *.pdf) in figures/
  - the README.md and CITATION.cff

The short context snippets included in the validation CSV files are
taken from H. B. Dewing's English translation of Procopius, published
in the Loeb Classical Library between 1914 and 1935; these are in the
public domain in the United States. The original Greek text of
Procopius is itself in the public domain everywhere.

